    C*** END ADD *** 08/22/02 *********************************************
     C*** BEG ADD *** 10/17/02 *********************************************
     C                   exsr      pmodld
     C*** END ADD *** 10/17/02 *********************************************
     C                   endif
    C*
     C                   movel     'P'           catype
     C                   exsr      recu
    C*
     C                   else
    C*
    C*   Else - treat line item as a procedure code from the CPT4 file
     C                   if        eobtyp = 'N'
     C                             and carcfl = 'C'
    C*
     C     dhky          chain     pdh01                              60
    C*
     C                   if        *in60 = *off
     C                   move      dhprcd        cacpt4
    C*** BEG ADD *** 08/22/02 *********************************************
