    C*
     C                   movel     'P'           catype
    C*
     C                   exsr      proc
    C*
     C                   else
    C*
    C*   Else - treat line item as a dental code
     C                   if        eobtyp = 'D'
    C*** BEG ADD *** 08/22/02 *********************************************
     C                             and carcfl = 'C'
    C*** END ADD *** 08/22/02 *********************************************
