     C*** BEG DEL *** 10/02/03 ****************************************
     C****************** clear                   pcawk2
     C*** END DEL *** 10/02/03 ****************************************
    C*** END ADD *** 08/13/02 ****************************************
    C*
    C*    Clear CAPAID in detail file to reprocess correctly.
    C*    Provider bills is supposed to do this before adjudication
     C                   if        cacscd = '1  '
     C                             or cacscd = '001'
    C*
